 ## Operating characteristics
-
-*   **Time Complexity:** $O(N)$ in the worst case where all points are visible, but typically significantly less due to culling. The traversal is proportional to the number of visible nodes at the selected LOD levels.
-*   **Memory Complexity:** $O(N)$ for storing the octree structure and cached averages, where $N$ is the number of points in the original cloud.
