-*   **Strengths:** Reduces GPU bandwidth by aggregating points; simple to implement; effective for large, sparse point clouds.
-*   **Limitations:** CPU-bound; may result in visible popping if LOD transitions are not smooth; less accurate than screen-space error metrics.
